{{~##
   One Java file holding every generated type as a nested class of the accessor.

   Nested rather than one file per type, because Java demands a public top-level type
   be alone in a file named after it, and a generator that writes forty files is harder
   to place in a project than one that writes two.

   Anything needing the model arrives already rendered from JavaView.
##~}}
